    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Indravati National Park is the only national park in Chhattisgarh to be designated as a Tiger Reserve.",
        "Tamor Pingla is the largest wildlife sanctuary by area, whereas Badalkhol is the smallest in Chhattisgarh.",
        "Chitrakote Waterfall on the Indravati River in Bastar district is frequently asked as the 'Niagara Falls of India'."
      ],
      "id": "bgs55zz"
